          "rationale": "Two copper layers at nominal 70 µm each. 1.6 mm FR4, 0.16 mm minimum trace/space, 0.254 mm PTH annulus and 20% trace-width tolerance. Source-backed native footprint annuli were checked before routing."
        },
        {
          "kind": "stackup",
          "reference": "pathfinder-unrouted.kicad_pcb setup.stackup",
          "rationale": "F.Cu and B.Cu 0.07 mm each; FR4 core 1.44 mm and solder mask 0.01 mm per side. This requests 2 oz copper; it is not a measured finished stackup."
        },
        {
          "kind": "assumption",
          "reference": "battery-current-review.json",
          "rationale": "External 1.5 ohm resistor bench pulse draws 2.90 A at 4.35 V for 1000 ms. Illustrative auxiliary 1 A at 5 V/80% efficiency totals 4.337 A before buzzer and tolerances. Camera current and thermal performance are not measured."
        }
      ],
